9\r\n\r\nAdds a new advanced project setting: `debug/shader_language/errors/output_shader_contents_on_error`. This neatly joins the `debug/shader_language/warnings` family of advanced project settings.\r\n\r\nThe setting is `false` by default, because any project making use of shader include files is likely to have serious performance issues with it enabled. And, the error messages (which this PR leaves alone) are already enough to locate problems without the extreme console spam.\r\n\r\nImplementing it as a project setting, rather than an editor setting, respects the engine's ideal dependency chain. See the following for details:\r\n\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/53295\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/29730\r\n\r\nThe files changed may look a bit messy, but it's mostly just indentation due to the new `should_print_contents` condition wrapping a block of otherwise unchanged code.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance